  "description": {
   "en": "Oribeya Sumito, a good-natured office worker, attends a blind date with his business partner. After the breakup, he decides to let a beautiful woman, Rainako Sewaya, stay at his house after she misses the last train... She was such an extreme cleaning fanatic who loved dirty rooms! Possessing lots of health knowledge, the inevitable fainting in agony Kamaware DAYS, with ecchi start beautifully and squeaky clean! (MTL)",
   "ja": "取引先との合コンに参加した、お人好しな会社員の織部谷 澄人。 解散後、終電を逃した美女・瀬和谷 来菜子を一晩自宅に泊めることに。そんな彼女は、汚部屋が大好きな極度の掃除マニアだった…!?　健康知識が盛り沢山！"
  },
